                  description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The power distribution system shall compute the Motor i shut down signal as follows : IF Motor 1 disabled is &amp;quot;Requested&amp;quot; THEN Motor i shut down signal is &amp;quot;shut down&amp;quot; ELSE Motor i shut down is &amp;quot;not shut down&amp;quot;.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
